This directory contains the source code for the Qt Meta Object
Compiler (moc).

The files moc_yacc.cpp, moc_yacc.h and moc_lex.cpp are generated from
moc.y and moc.l. They are kept in the repository, so building moc does
not require yacc or lex.

After changing moc.y or moc.l, regenerate them in this directory with
GNU bison (in yacc mode) and flex:

    bison -y -d -o moc_yacc.cpp --defines=moc_yacc.h moc.y
    flex -o moc_lex.cpp moc.l

The files in the repository were generated with GNU Bison 3.8.2 and
flex 2.6.4.
